{"id":"entorno","lemma":"entorno","pos":"noun","rank":3870,"glosses":["surroundings, environment, setting, milieu, atmosphere","entourage"],"ipa":"/enˈtoɾno/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"entornos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-entorno.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ten cuidado de tu entorno.","en":"Be aware of your surroundings.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"care (close attention"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Nuestro entorno laboral fue bueno.","en":"Our working environment was good.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741272","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us"},null,{"g":"labor"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"good"}]},{"text":"Este es un buen entorno de aprendizaje.","en":"This is a good learning environment.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"learning"}]},{"text":"Los entornos rurales son muy tranquilos para mí.","en":"Rural environments are too quiet for me.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"rural","l":"rural"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"calm","l":"tranquilo"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"in my opinion"]]},{"text":"El paisaje en este entorno es muy bonito.","en":"The scenery around here is very beautiful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306391","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"landscape"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"pretty, cute"}]}]}